    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a relentless hunt through vibrant, demon-infested lands in this adrenaline-fueled rogue-lite bullet-heaven experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with a diverse arsenal of unique and upgradable weapons, each offering powerful evolution paths that drastically reshape your combat style. Face overwhelming swarms of vividly designed, otherworldly creatures as you carve your way through mystical worlds filled with ancient spirits, celestial beasts, and legendary foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/9df37eb7d62cad44f5523abaee625b31.poster.avif?t=1753887620\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/9df37eb7d62cad44f5523abaee625b31.webm?t=1753887620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/aed98c99cc1cf53527c9c1247bfd9eb2.webp?t=1753887620\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle intense, varied bosses while a rising threat level adds unique challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run feels fresh and fun with new modifiers to adapt to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/24a46f2f8b89d710ec5ebe82d61a579e.poster.avif?t=1753887620\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/24a46f2f8b89d710ec5ebe82d61a579e.webm?t=1753887620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/f4ac41891f3a4ddd9e83cb7076e6c85e.webp?t=1753887620\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect weapons and artifacts that work together to make your attacks stronger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon can evolve in 3 unique ways, choose the path that fits your playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/00f1f8f6ed6fb6ac6a32bafd3e0ad817.poster.avif?t=1753887620\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/00f1f8f6ed6fb6ac6a32bafd3e0ad817.webm?t=1753887620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/0c365f776d28e1eb3d9308f7699d5725.webp?t=1753887620\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot powerful items to boost stats and unlock special abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back at your base, recycle, craft, and upgrade your gear to grow even stronger between runs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/e5f7c82886ea6cc301963448a0c05f2b.poster.avif?t=1753887620\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/e5f7c82886ea6cc301963448a0c05f2b.webm?t=1753887620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/0a8564c3e36457bc4b953410cc00b1c9.webp?t=1753887620\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick one of three distinct mechas, each with a signature ability and custom talent tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mecha offers a fresh playstyle. Master them all to unlock their full potential!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/9c37bd7f2b8ff4b20b12555a076fa78d.poster.avif?t=1753887620\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/9c37bd7f2b8ff4b20b12555a076fa78d.webm?t=1753887620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/90333a7a6b1929cf3c658d07e7b72dbd.webp?t=1753887620\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Orbs and slot them into specialized nodes to change how they activate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your mechas with talent points, craft unique combos, and unlock deep tactical builds. The possibilities are endless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/db4a3acba3ec722f15d234ebcd845b77.poster.avif?t=1753887620\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/db4a3acba3ec722f15d234ebcd845b77.webm?t=1753887620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/ed5119f02d0b2af6b7b117f736357f89.webp?t=1753887620\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant environment full of shrines, altars, chests, and hidden rewards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay, collect, and grow stronger with every step of the hunt! With more maps to come!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/6d28c40b3a8188cd9a5b18b91bcaebbe.poster.avif?t=1753887620\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/6d28c40b3a8188cd9a5b18b91bcaebbe.webm?t=1753887620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/eb887a79621bc7d0ffe765931a2d361a.avif?t=1753887620\" data-has-big width=800 height=315 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is being developed by a solo developer, with the help of your feedback and support.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a relentless hunt through vibrant, demon-infested lands in this adrenaline-fueled rogue-lite bullet-heaven experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with a diverse arsenal of unique and upgradable weapons, each offering powerful evolution paths that drastically reshape your combat style. Face overwhelming swarms of vividly designed, otherworldly creatures as you carve your way through mystical worlds filled with ancient spirits, celestial beasts, and legendary foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/9df37eb7d62cad44f5523abaee625b31.poster.avif?t=1753887620\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/9df37eb7d62cad44f5523abaee625b31.webm?t=1753887620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/aed98c99cc1cf53527c9c1247bfd9eb2.webp?t=1753887620\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle intense, varied bosses while a rising threat level adds unique challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run feels fresh and fun with new modifiers to adapt to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/24a46f2f8b89d710ec5ebe82d61a579e.poster.avif?t=1753887620\" width=616 height=298 ><source s